msgid "Orbital localization"
msgstr "轨道定域化"

msgid "The localization program is invoked by the ``LOCALI`` command"
msgstr "定域化程序通过 ``LOCALI`` 命令调用"

msgid ""
"The keyword *method* can be either ``BOYS``, ``PIPEK``, ``NATURAL``, ``IBO``"
" By default, the canonical valence orbitals from the last energy calculation"
" are localized using the Boys criterion. Only orbital subsets which leave "
"the energy invariant are transformed. These defaults can be modified using "
"the optional commands described in the following sections."
msgstr ""
"关键字 *method* 可以是 ``BOYS``\\ 、\\ ``PIPEK``\\ 、\\ ``NATURAL``\\ 、\\ ``IBO``\\ "
"。默认情况下，使用 Boys "
"准则对上一次能量计算得到的正则价层轨道进行定域化。仅对不改变能量的轨道子集进行变换。这些默认值可以使用以下章节中描述的可选命令进行修改。"

msgid ""
"The option ``LOCMETHOD`` only applies to Pipek-Mezey localization. The value"
" *locmethod* can take the following values:"
msgstr "选项 ``LOCMETHOD`` 仅适用于 Pipek-Mezey 定域化。值 *locmethod* 可以取以下值："

msgid ""
"The option ``REFORB`` has the same effect as the directive ``REFORB`` "
"described further below."
msgstr "选项 ``REFORB`` 与下文描述的指令 ``REFORB`` 具有相同的效果。"

msgid ""
"The option ``THRPIP`` (``THRBOYS`` is an alias) is the threshold used for "
"Pipek-Mezey or Boys localization (same as ``THRESH`` in section "
"`localization thresholds (THRESH) <orbital_localization.html#localization-"
"thresholds-thresh>`__)."
msgstr ""
"选项 ``THRPIP``\\ （\\ ``THRBOYS`` 是其别名）是用于 Pipek-Mezey 或 Boys 定域化的阈值（与 "
"`localization thresholds (THRESH) <orbital_localization.html#localization-"
"thresholds-thresh>`__ 章节中的 ``THRESH`` 相同）。"

msgid "Defining the input orbitals (ORBITAL)"
msgstr "定义输入轨道（ORBITAL）"

msgid ""
"The orbitals to be localized are read from dump record *record.file*. A "
"state specific orbital set can be selected using *specifications*, as "
"explained in section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, "
"DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-"
"matrices-orbital-density>`__. Default are the orbitals calculated last."
msgstr ""
"待定域化的轨道从转储记录 *record.file* 中读取。可以使用 *specifications* 选择特定于状态的轨道集，如 "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 章节所述。默认为最后计算的轨道。"

msgid "Saving the localized orbitals (SAVE)"
msgstr "保存定域化轨道（SAVE）"

msgid ""
"This specifies the dump record where the localized orbitals are stored. If "
"the dump record already exists, the localized orbitals are added to it. "
"Default is the input record (cf. ``ORBITAL``)."
msgstr "此选项指定存储定域轨道的转储记录文件。如果该转储记录已存在，定域轨道将被添加至其中。默认值为输入记录（参见 ``ORBITAL``\\ ）。"

msgid "Choosing the localization method (METHOD)"
msgstr "选择定域化方法（METHOD）"

msgid ""
"The localization method *method* can be either ``BOYS``, ``PIPEK``, "
"``NATURAL``, or ``IBO``. This can also be specified as argument on the "
"``LOCALI`` card (see above)."
msgstr ""
"定域化方法 *method* 可以是 ``BOYS``\\ 、\\ ``PIPEK``\\ 、\\ ``NATURAL`` 或 ``IBO``\\ "
"。这也可以在 ``LOCALI`` 卡片上作为参数指定（见上文）。"

msgid "Delocalization of orbitals (DELOCAL)"
msgstr "轨道的离域化（DELOCAL）"

msgid "``DELOCAL``"
msgstr "``DELOCAL``"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the orbitals are delocalized. This is not "
"implemented for ``NATURAL`` and ``IBO``."
msgstr "如果存在此卡片，轨道将被离域化。此功能未在 ``NATURAL`` 和 ``IBO`` 方法中实现。"

msgid "Localizing AOs(LOCAO)"
msgstr "定域化原子轨道（LOCAO）"

msgid "``LOCAO``"
msgstr "``LOCAO``"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the number of AOs contributing to each MO is "
"minimized. This can be useful to rotate degenerate orbitals (e.g., px, py, "
"pz in an atom) so that pure orbitals (in this case px, py, pz) result."
msgstr ""
"若存在此卡片，则最小化每个分子轨道（MO）所贡献的原子轨道（AO）数量。这对于旋转简并轨道（例如，原子中的px、py、pz轨道）以得到纯轨道（在本例中即px、py、pz）非常有用。"

msgid "This implies Pipek-Mezey localization."
msgstr "这意味着采用 Pipek-Mezey 定域化。"

msgid "Selecting the orbital space"
msgstr "选择轨道空间"

msgid ""
"By default, only the valence orbitals are localized, in order to ensure "
"invariance of subsequent electron correlation treatments. This behaviour can"
" be modified using the ``OCC`` and ``CORE`` directives, or the ``LOCCORE`` "
"option:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，仅对价层轨道进行定域化，以确保后续电子相关处理的不变性。此行为可通过 ``OCC`` 和 ``CORE`` 指令或 ``LOCCORE`` "
"选项进行修改："

msgid "``LOCCORE=0``: Core orbitals are not localized (default)"
msgstr "``LOCCORE=0``\\ ：芯轨道不定域化（默认）"

msgid ""
"``LOCCORE=1``: Core orbitals are localized together with all other orbitals"
msgstr "``LOCCORE=1``\\ ：芯轨道与所有其他轨道一起定域化"

msgid "``LOCCORE=2``: Core orbitals are localized among themselves."
msgstr "``LOCCORE=2``\\ ：芯轨道在自身内部定域化。"

msgid "By default, all non-valence orbitals are treated as core."
msgstr "默认情况下，所有非价层轨道均被视为芯轨道。"

msgid "Defining the occupied space (OCC)"
msgstr "定义占据空间 (OCC)"

msgid ""
"defines the highest orbital :math:`o_i` in each symmetry :math:`i` to be "
"localized."
msgstr "定义了每个对称性 :math:`i` 中要局域化的最高轨道 :math:`o_i`\\ 。"

msgid "Defining the core orbitals (CORE)"
msgstr "定义芯轨道 (CORE)"

msgid ""
"The first :math:`c_i` orbitals in each symmetry are treated as core orbitals"
" and not localized. Thus, orbitals :math:`c_i+1` to :math:`o_i` are "
"localized in symmetry :math:`i`."
msgstr ""
"每个对称性中的前 :math:`c_i` 个轨道被视为芯轨道且不进行局域化。因此，对称性 :math:`i` 中从 :math:`c_i+1` 到 "
":math:`o_i` 的轨道将被局域化。"

msgid "Defining groups of orbitals (GROUP, OFFDIAG)"
msgstr "定义轨道组 (GROUP, OFFDIAG)"

msgid "This card defines groups of orbitals to be localized as follows:"
msgstr "此卡片定义要定域化的轨道组，如下所示："

msgid "``GROUP,1.1,2.1,3.1`` a group of orbitals 1-3 in symmetry 1"
msgstr "``GROUP,1.1,2.1,3.1`` 对称性1中轨道1-3组成的一组"

msgid "``GROUP,1.1,-3.1`` equivalent to previous example"
msgstr "``GROUP,1.1,-3.1`` 等价于前一个示例"

msgid ""
"``GROUP,3.1,5.1,-8.1`` this group includes orbitals 3,5,6,7,8 in symmetry 1"
msgstr "``GROUP,3.1,5.1,-8.1`` 此组包含对称性1中的轨道3,5,6,7,8"

msgid ""
"Orbitals in different groups are localized independently. Orbitals not "
"included in any group are unchanged."
msgstr "不同组中的轨道独立进行定域化。未包含在任何组中的轨道保持不变。"

msgid "Localization between groups (OFFDIAG)"
msgstr "组间定域化 (OFFDIAG)"

msgid "``OFFDIAG``"
msgstr "``OFFDIAG``"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, localize between groups instead of within groups."
msgstr "若存在此卡片，则在组间而非组内进行定域化。"

msgid "Ordering of localized orbitals"
msgstr "定域轨道的排序"

msgid ""
"If *type*\\ =\\ ``CHARGE``, the orbitals are ordered according to their "
"charge centroids (default)."
msgstr "若 *type*\\ =\\ ``CHARGE``\\ ，轨道按其电荷中心排序（默认）。"

msgid ""
"If *type*\\ =\\ ``FOCK``, the orbitals are ordered according to increasing "
"diagonal elements of the fock operator (PIPEK) or increasing Coulson-"
"additive orbital energies (BOYS). This requires a Fock operator from the "
"preceding energy calculation. For localization of Hartree-Fock orbitals, "
"this operator is stored in the dump record and automatically found. For "
"localization of MCSCF orbitals, an effective fock operator is computed from "
"the MCSCF density matrix (see ``DENSITY`` option). Alternatively, a dump "
"record of a previous SCF calculation can be specified on the ``FOCK`` card, "
"and then the fock operator is read from this record. For degenerate "
"orbitals, further ordering according to the the coordinates of charge "
"centres is attempted (first according to largest z-coordinates, then "
"according to x, then y)."
msgstr ""
"若 *type*\\ =\\ ``FOCK``\\ ，轨道按 Fock 算符对角元的递增顺序（PIPEK）或 Coulson "
"加和轨道能的递增顺序（BOYS）排序。这需要来自前一步能量计算的 Fock 算符。对于 Hartree-Fock "
"轨道的定域化，该算符存储在转储记录中并会自动找到。对于 MCSCF 轨道的定域化，将从 MCSCF 密度矩阵计算一个有效的 Fock 算符（参见 "
"``DENSITY`` 选项）。或者，可以在 ``FOCK`` 卡片上指定先前 SCF 计算的转储记录，然后从该记录读取 Fock "
"算符。对于简并轨道，会尝试根据电荷中心的坐标进行进一步排序（首先按最大 z 坐标，然后按 x，再按 y）。"

msgid "This card does not apply to NLMO localization."
msgstr "此卡片不适用于 NLMO 定域化。"

msgid "No reordering (NOORDER)"
msgstr "不重新排序（NOORDER）"

msgid "``NOORDER``"
msgstr "``NOORDER``"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the localized orbitals are not reordered. This is "
"useful if localized orbitals are used as starting guess, and it is intended "
"that their order remains unchanged."
msgstr "若存在此卡片，则定域轨道不会被重新排序。当定域轨道用作初始猜测，且希望其顺序保持不变时，这很有用。"

msgid "Ordering using domains (SORT)"
msgstr "使用域进行排序 (SORT)"

msgid ""
"This directive only works for Pipek-Mezey localization. The orbitals are "
"ordered according to domains and the given centrelist. The contributions of "
"the centres to domains are determined by Löwdin charges. Only centres with "
"charges greater than ``THRCHCHG`` (default 0.4) are included in these "
"domains. The orbitals are reordered according to the following criteria:"
msgstr ""
"此指令仅适用于 Pipek-Mezey 定域化。轨道根据域和给定的中心列表进行排序。中心对域的贡献由 Löwdin 电荷决定。只有电荷大于 "
"``THRCHCHG``\\ （默认值 0.4）的中心才会包含在这些域中。轨道根据以下标准重新排序："

msgid ""
"The primary centre in a domain is the one with largest charge, the secondary"
" centre the one with the next largest charge. Orbitals are reordered "
"separately within each localization group. First all orbitals are sorted so "
"that the primary centres are in the order of the given *centrelist*. "
"Orbitals with primary centres which are not in *centrelist* come last."
msgstr ""
"域中的主要中心是电荷最大的中心，次要中心是电荷次大的中心。轨道在每个定域化组内分别重新排序。首先，对所有轨道进行排序，使主要中心按照给定的 "
"*centrelist* 顺序排列。主要中心不在 *centrelist* 中的轨道排在最后。"

msgid ""
"Within each group of orbitals found for a given primary centre, those "
"containing only one centre (lone pairs) are included first. The remaining "
"ones are ordered so that the secondary atoms are in the order of "
"*centrelist*. Orbitals with secondary centres which are not in *centrelist* "
"come last."
msgstr ""
"在针对给定主要中心找到的每组轨道中，首先包含那些仅含有一个中心（孤对电子）的轨道。剩余的轨道按照次要原子在 *centrelist* "
"中的顺序进行排序。次要中心不在 *centrelist* 中的轨道排在最后。"

msgid ""
"If ``REVERT`` is given, the order in each localization group is reverted."
msgstr "如果给出 ``REVERT``\\ ，则每个定域化组内的顺序将被反转。"

msgid ""
"If ``GROUP`` is given, only the orbitals in the given group are reordered. "
"*igrp* is 2 for closed shells and inactive orbitals, 1 for open-shells in "
"single reference methods, and 3 for active orbitals in CASSCF calculations."
msgstr ""
"如果给出 ``GROUP``\\ ，则仅对指定组中的轨道进行重新排序。\\ *igrp* 对于闭壳层和非活性轨道为 2，对于单参考方法中的开壳层为 "
"1，对于 CASSCF 计算中的活性轨道为 3。"

msgid ""
"If ``THREIG`` is given, only orbitals with energies larger than the given "
"value are reordered. *eps* must be negative. The remaining orbitals come "
"last (first if ``REVERT`` is given)."
msgstr ""
"如果给出 ``THREIG``\\ ，则仅对能量大于给定值的轨道进行重排序。\\ *eps* 必须为负值。其余轨道排在最后（如果给出 "
"``REVERT`` 则排在最前）。"

msgid "Note that core orbitals are neither localized nor reordered."
msgstr "请注意，芯轨道既不定域化也不重排序。"

msgid "Defining reference orbitals (REFORB)"
msgstr "定义参考轨道 (REFORB)"

msgid ""
"The localized orbitals are reordered such that the overlap with the "
"reference orbitals read from *record.file* is maximized. This is useful for "
"local correlation treatments for keeping the order of the localized constant"
" for different geometries. A state specific orbital set can be selected "
"using *specifications*, as explained in section `selecting orbitals and "
"density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__."
msgstr ""
"定域轨道被重排序，以最大化其与从 *record.file* "
"读取的参考轨道的重叠。这对于局域相关处理非常有用，可以保持定域轨道的顺序在不同几何结构下恒定。可以使用 *specifications* "
"选择特定状态的轨道集，如章节 `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 所述。"

msgid "Selecting the fock matrix (FOCK)"
msgstr "选择 Fock 矩阵 (FOCK)"

msgid ""
"This specifies a record holding a Fock operator to be used for ordering the "
"orbitals. Note that only SCF dump records hold fock operators. Default is "
"the Fock operator from the energy calculation which produced the input "
"orbitals."
msgstr ""
"这指定了一个包含 Fock 算符的记录，用于对轨道进行排序。请注意，只有 SCF 转储记录包含 Fock 算符。默认值是产生输入轨道的能量计算中的 "
"Fock 算符。"

msgid "Selecting a density matrix (DENSITY)"
msgstr "选择密度矩阵 (DENSITY)"

msgid ""
"This specifies a record holding a density matrix for construction of a fock "
"operator used for ordering the orbitals. This can be used if no fock "
"operator is available, and has only an effect for MCSCF localizations. By "
"default, the (state averaged) MCSCF density is used. A state specific "
"density matrix can be selected using *specifications* as described in "
"section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__."
msgstr ""
"此指令指定一个记录，该记录包含用于构建Fock算符以排序轨道的密度矩阵。当没有可用的Fock算符时，可以使用此选项，且仅对MCSCF定域化有效。默认情况下，使用（态平均的）MCSCF密度。可以使用\\"
" *specifications*\\ 选择特定态的密度矩阵，如章节\\ `选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__\\ 所述。"

msgid "Localization thresholds (THRESH)"
msgstr "定域化阈值 (THRESH)"

msgid ""
"*thresh* is a threshold for localization (default 1.d-9). If *eorder* is "
"nonzero (default 1.d-4), the orbitals whose energy difference is smaller "
"then *eorder* are considered to be degenerate and reordered according to the"
" position of their charge centres (see section `ordering of localized "
"orbitals <orbital_localization.html#ordering-of-localized-orbitals>`__)."
msgstr ""
"*thresh* 是定域化的阈值（默认值为 1.d-9）。如果 *eorder* 非零（默认值为 1.d-4），则能量差小于 *eorder* "
"的轨道被视为简并，并根据其电荷中心的位置重新排序（参见章节\\ `定域轨道的排序 "
"<orbital_localization.html#ordering-of-localized-orbitals>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Options for PM localization (PIPEK)"
msgstr "PM 定域化选项 (PIPEK)"

msgid ""
"Some special options exist for Pipek-Mezey localization and can be given on "
"the ``PIPEK`` directive (optional):"
msgstr "存在一些用于 Pipek-Mezey 定域化的特殊选项，可以在 ``PIPEK`` 指令中给出（可选）："

msgid "Printing options (PRINT)"
msgstr "打印选项 (PRINT)"
